    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Witch is a cutting edge rogue-like collectathon, about exploring the universe alongside your trusty familiar. Gather stars to earn talents and become the space witch of your dreams! <br> <br>&quot;A bizarre fusion of <strong>Asteroids</strong>, <strong>Hades</strong>, and <strong>Katamari Damacy</strong>.&quot; - Some guy <br> <br>Play your way:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Casually vibe through space at your own pace.</i></strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OR</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Try hard competing for a high score!</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours! <br> <br><i>Just watch out for them space rocks...</i></p>",
